## Tivret instruction

When this design becomes an approved implementation task, Tivret should:

- implement the smallest sample-only factory wrapper first;
- keep RigVM additions allowlisted and optional in any later pass;
- add Python wrapper and server registration only after the C++ response schema
  is stable;
- document the command in `Docs/Tools/anim_controlrig_tools.md`;
- avoid runtime modules, gameplay code, Sequencer operations, final asset
  mutation, or broad ControlRig graph authoring;
- verify dry-run, create, preview mesh readback, optional bounded hierarchy
  import, optional direct curves, optional direct nulls, optional scalar direct
  controls, optional named parent, null transform, direct control shape metadata,
  and euler transform control readback, compile/init result, downstream sample
  AnimBP use when relevant, and no-dirty-source behavior.
